flowchart LR
    U([User])
    B[Browser]
    AS[Auth Server]
    BE[Backend Service]
    SS[(Session Store)]

    U -->|1. Log In username + password| B
    B -->|2. Authenticate| AS
    AS -->|3. Create session| SS
    AS -->|4. Cookie with session-ID| B
    U -->|5. Access page| B
    B -->|6. Request + cookie| BE
    BE -->|7. Verify session| SS
    BE -->|8. Response data| B
